                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58897dbb-bbdd-4103-a69d-4e5cd3a5dd06",
                                                "sense_id": "6f8c7e55-143a-3bf3-99d9-024589a753f0",
                                                "text": "Они как-то ухитрились достать оружие."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92dcbe01-ab06-3c42-b283-ff8572c7ccdf",
                                        "entry_id": "4fee5f2d-e610-33fe-97a0-5676b31c39e0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "разг. в некоторой степени, несколько, довольно"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fcc175cb-2631-4cc5-acd5-ec2af96cccb6",
                                                "sense_id": "92dcbe01-ab06-3c42-b283-ff8572c7ccdf",
                                                "text": "И выглядел он как-то странно."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a33969f-42fb-3b25-be2c-dfaa5a52be2e",
                                        "entry_id": "4fee5f2d-e610-33fe-97a0-5676b31c39e0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "разг. однажды в прошлом, когда-то"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6ce9950-080c-4114-a9ed-ca620e72e014",
                                                "sense_id": "9a33969f-42fb-3b25-be2c-dfaa5a52be2e",
                                                "text": "Как-то я иду по улице."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "16088541-1b73-3c9a-9f19-afb435c783d1",
                                        "entry_id": "4fee5f2d-e610-33fe-97a0-5676b31c39e0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "прост. каким же образом"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "союзн. или вопрос. слово,"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3027b967-58b8-47d0-887b-c2e656402efb",
                                                "sense_id": "16088541-1b73-3c9a-9f19-afb435c783d1",
                                                "text": "Мне стало любопытно, как-то он на этот раз выкрутится?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "df84d5e3-6217-4309-8e53-86c8444e6547",
                        "source_entry_id": "ce8b6a92-49db-3937-b367-7607a995c6a5",
                        "source_sense_id": "d4619980-f78e-3320-89b9-81b22545bb82",
                        "target_lang_word": "somewhy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "somewhy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba1105b5-8e6a-3f0d-a21e-f1d6ab56109c",
                                        "entry_id": "803c96a7-902a-38f9-876f-e9e59d10487e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "For some reason."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d36705be-834f-4fda-8e38-1088af60b618",
                                                "sense_id": "ba1105b5-8e6a-3f0d-a21e-f1d6ab56109c",
                                                "text": "Out of the drift of facts, whereby you learn\n What some was, somewhere, somewhen, somewhy?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a369257-8ebc-4866-b288-ce52ab80d0b0",
                                                "sense_id": "ba1105b5-8e6a-3f0d-a21e-f1d6ab56109c",
                                                "text": "I loved them both—but not so very much else in the book—but I read them over twice & thought—somewhy—of Highland Park & our quaint little trips to Los Angles^([sic]) & elsewhere thereabouts on the street car."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de0c2128-7bbb-4ade-8e07-9f946d8db086",
                                                "sense_id": "ba1105b5-8e6a-3f0d-a21e-f1d6ab56109c",
                                                "text": "Somewhy I've always had this stupid idea that something or something or somebody awful is waiting here for me."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e65e10a-0060-411e-8ae4-7efa428a8ce0",
                                                "sense_id": "ba1105b5-8e6a-3f0d-a21e-f1d6ab56109c",
                                                "text": "But somehow, somewhy, he did something and that woman knew it. And somehow, somewhy on a whole lot of other days he doesn't do anything we can see ..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5f99bfc-0c0e-4766-9fdc-a96b4f337749",
                                                "sense_id": "ba1105b5-8e6a-3f0d-a21e-f1d6ab56109c",
                                                "text": "Or is it actually him? Still holding on somewhere, somehow, somewhy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0d80565b-95b7-4c10-9d7d-d9b94e1f52dd",
                        "source_entry_id": "ce8b6a92-49db-3937-b367-7607a995c6a5",
                        "source_sense_id": "d4619980-f78e-3320-89b9-81b22545bb82",
